# Contributing to Gooney-emu

First and foremost, thank you for your interest in **Gooney-emu**! 

Please note that this project is developed and maintained purely as a part-time, personal hobby project. Because of limited time and capacity, **I am not accepting pull requests (PRs) or managing ongoing code contributions.**

## How You Can Participate

If you want to use, modify, or experiment with this project, here is the best way to do so:

1. **Fork the Repository:** Feel free to click the **Fork** button on GitHub and adapt Gooney-emu however you see fit for your own experiments, learning, or personal projects.
2. **Use Issues for Discussion (Optional):** If you spot a bug or have a question, you are welcome to open an issue to share thoughts, but please understand that response times and bug fixes are not guaranteed.

Thank you for understanding and respecting these boundaries! Happy emulating! 🚀
